`GET /graph/knowledge`\n(params `workspace`, `mode=connected|all|macro`, `source_id?`, `run_id?`) delegating to the new\nfunction. Same `Neo4j not available → 503` / `Exception → 500` guard as `/graph/full` (line 404).\nKeep the existing `/graph/full` untouched (code graph / other callers still use it).\n\n### 2. Frontend widget — trigger the fallback on error, use the lean endpoint, drop the cap\n\n`app/L0/_all/mod/_prime_silo/widgets/kg3d/synoptic_web/index.js`:\n\n- **Fix the trigger (core bug):** in `load()`, wrap the `/kg3d/ontology` call so that a **throw\n  or non-OK** *also* falls through to the fallback (today only an empty payload does). Ontology\n  stays the fast path for small workspaces; longview's 500 now degrades gracefully instead of\n  erroring out.\n- **Repoint + rewrite `loadGraphFullFallback()` → `loadKnowledgeGraph()`:** call\n  `/graph/knowledge?workspace=…&mode=<mode>` instead of `/graph/full?show_all=true`. Keep the\n  same node-shape adaptation (id/display_name/category/aot_layer/metrics) and the\n  connectivity-based layering already there (`Source`→layer 1, hubs high, leaves low).\n- **Remove `FALLBACK_NODE_BUDGET = 400`** and the degree-sort truncation for connected/macro\n  modes (the set is already small). Retain a large safety ceiling **only** for `mode=\"all\"`\n  orphan dust (e.g. 20k) to protect the SVG default renderer used in tests.\n- Add a `mode` prop (`connected` default) and a `sourceId` prop; changing either re-fetches\n  (extend the `fetchKeyChanged` check in `update()`).\n\n### 3. Frontend Bridge — the toggles + a lite render mode\n\n`app/L0/_all/mod/_prime_silo/bridge/bridge.js` (Documents view, `mountKnowledgeGraph()` ~L880):\n\n- State: `docsGraphMode` (`connected|all|macro`), pass as `mode` prop to `createSynopticWebWidget`.\n- Toolbar controls near the existing 3D/physics toggles (~L901): a mode selector\n  **Connected / Everything / Documents**, and in macro mode, clicking a Source calls\n  `mountKnowledgeGraph({ mode