see everything meaningful\" is inherently light once code is excluded.\n\n**Fix (user chose connected + macro as toggles):**\n- **Backend:** new `get_knowledge_graph(workspace, mode, run_id, source_id)` in `runtime/benny/core/graph_db.py` + `GET /graph/knowledge` in `runtime/benny/api/graph_routes.py`. Code-free (only Concept/Source/Document + `KNOWLEDGE_RELS = RELATES_TO/SOURCED_FROM/PREREQUISITE_FOR/CONFLICTS_WITH/ANALOGOUS_TO`), no metrics compute. Modes: `connected` (endpoints ∪ all Sources — 2,179 nodes, no cap), `all` (+orphans, ~76k), `macro` (61 Sources sized by `concept_count`; `source_id` drills into one document). Cypher `SIZE([(c)-[:SOURCED_FROM]->(s) | c])` for concept_count works (no APOC in this Neo4j).\n- **Widget:** `load()` now falls back on ontology **throw OR empty**; fallback renamed `loadKnowledgeGraph()` → `/graph/knowledge?mode=`; 400 `FALLBACK_NODE_BUDGET` removed (only a 20k `ORPHAN_NODE_CEILING` for `all`); new `mode`/`sourceId` props + `fetchKeyChanged`.\n- **Lite render (the \"less-intensive fallback\" user asked for):** `force_graph_2d/index.js` — above `LITE_NODE_THRESHOLD=2000` nodes (or `options.lite`): no trace particles, labels only when zoomed/hot, glow off, warmupTicks 8 / cooldownTime 1200. Powers the \"Everything\" orphan view without windowing.\n- **Bridge:** `bridge.js` + `view.html` Documents toolbar — Connected/Everything/Documents selector + macro \"click doc → expand → ← Back\" (`docsGraphMode`, `docsSourceId`, `setDocsGraphMode`, `onDocsNodeSelect`, `clearDocsDrilldown`).\n\n**Verification:** py_compile OK; all 3 modes validated by live Cypher (connected 2,179 nodes / 61 sources / **0 code leak**; macro 61 docs, max 89 concepts; edges 3,719). Widget mjs tests rewritten + pass (fallback-on-500, uncapped connected render, mode-change refetch); `widgets_force_graph_2d_test` passes. `bridge_documents_test::testIngestPushesWorkspace` still fails — **pre-existing**, verified by git-stash on pristine files (same as noted in [[benny_pilot_documents_and_no_selection_fix]]).\n\n**Not done / notes:** authoritative backend is `runtime/benny/` (what ships); `prime-silo-core/benny/` is a stale older fork (no `get_full_graph`) — left untouched. No live HTTP e2e (runtime 127.0.0.1:8005, key `benny-mesh-2026-auth`, reached via Node `/api/runtime/*` proxy) — Python route needs a runtime restart to load; user should relaunch + reload Bridge to see it live. No backend pytest added (Neo4j-dependent; live Cypher covered it).\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3226,"cache_read_input_tokens":198624,"output_tokens":2125,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3226,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2125,"cache_read_input_tokens":198624,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3226,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3226},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcfiHquQmX38D3VZer7H8","attributionMcpServer":"prime-silo-nexus","attributionMcpTool":"execute_cypher","type":"assistant","uuid":"b375f500-a79c-4a89-b425-b9183a3b103f","timestamp":"2026-07-03T19:56:32.368Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo","sessionId":"4cd9df3b-c431-4ac3-8790-b888629655bb","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"warm-beaming-pretzel"}
