/ 1,400 RELATES_TO endpoints share a source; **0 cross-document** |","-| Concepts bridge docs only by exact name match | 2,063 of 2,118 concepts are sourced from exactly 1 document; only ~55 shared |","-| Typed relations don't exist as edges | `PREREQUISITE_FOR / CONFLICTS_WITH / ANALOGOUS_TO / CORRELATES_WITH` = **0 in the whole DB**; everything is `RELATES_TO {predicate:<free text>}` |","-| Code↔docs never correlated | `CORRELATES_WITH` = 0 for longview; the 200k-node code graph is fully disjoint from the 2,118 concepts |","-| No categorisation | `concept.category` and `concept.domain` are **null for all 2,118**; embeddings are **not persisted**; `community_id` is set but only clusters within document islands |","+A fresh workspace (`longview_v2`) keeps the already-enriched `longview` graph untouched and gives a","+true baseline. The runner already parameterises the workspace via `LONGVIEW_WORKSPACE`","+(`scripts/longview/lib/config.mjs:51`), so nothing is hard-coded to `longview`."," ","-Root cause in code:","-- `save_knowledge_triples()` (`runtime/benny/graph/triples.py`) writes `MERGE (s:Concept {name,workspace})`,","-  one `RELATES_TO {predicate}` per triple, and `SOURCED_FROM`. Relationships only ever connect a","-  triple's subject→object — always the same document. Cross-doc bridging relies entirely on **exact","-  name-MERGE**, which rarely fires (names are verbatim: `\"strategy\" field`, `Vaild JSON Output`).","-- `run_safe_correlation` / `run_aggressive_correlation` (`runtime/benny/synthesis/correlation.py`) link","-  **Concept↔CodeEntity only**, never Concept↔Concept, and were never invoked in the longview path.","+**Decisions (user):** wire enrichment as a real pipeline **phase** (one-command E2E, repeatable);","+audiobook narrated with **Kokoro (bf_emma)** via `02_run_kokoro.py`."," ","-So the answer to \"gap in correlation logic, or need more relations/categorisation?\" is **both**: there","-is no cross-document concept linking at all, relation types