{"parentUuid":"f62e0066-606c-443b-b0b7-aad578eec2f3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01A6RnhYuRp1KBuozVR57LS3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Vk7qrSLfSD6WTFpk55MSYR","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-nsdha-OneDrive-binary16\\memory\\longview_memoray_source_fix.md","content":"---\nname: longview-memoray-source-fix\ndescription: \"LONGVIEW inventory was reading a stale memo-ray store + blind to Claude sessions — data-dir mismatch (~/.mem0ray vs sibling checkout) + undefined CLAUDE_LOG_DIRS\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n---\n\n2026-07-04, setting up a clean `longview_v2` run: inventory reported only **7 Claude** sessions (vs ~40 `.jsonl` in `~/.claude/projects`, 18 recent). Two compounding bugs, both fixed. See [[project_longview_session_synthesis]] and [[prime_silo_longview_graph_enrichment]].\n\n**Bug 1 — stale store (data-dir mismatch).** `scripts/longview/lib/config.mjs` resolves `MEMORAY_DATA_DIR` as `[<sibling>/memo-ray/agent-os-dashboard/server/data, ~/.mem0ray/data, <vendored>].find(has index.json)` — the **sibling dev checkout wins**. But the memo-ray server + parsers WRITE to `~/.mem0ray/data`. So longview read a **stale June-15 sibling snapshot** (130 sessions / 7 Claude) while the live store `~/.mem0ray/data` had 227 sessions synced today. Fix: set `MEMORAY_DATA_DIR=C:\\Users\\nsdha\\.mem0ray\\data` in `prime-silo/.env` (config.mjs honors the env first). `.env` is gitignored — the override is local, not committed.\n\n**Bug 2 — Claude dirs undefined.** memo-ray's `config.CLAUDE_LOG_DIRS` resolved to **undefined**, so the direct-parser fallback (`store.mjs syncStore()` → `parsers/claudeParser.syncClaude()`, used when the memo-ray server is down) scanned **zero** Claude dirs. `claudeParser.getClaudeBaseDirs()` reads `MEM0RAY_CLAUDE_DIRS` env or `config.CLAUDE_LOG_DIRS`. Fix (commit 6e56b9c): `config.mjs` adds `CLAUDE_DIRS` (default `~/.claude/projects`, override `MEM0RAY_CLAUDE_DIRS`); `store.mjs syncStore` passes `env:{...process.env, MEM0RAY_CLAUDE_DIRS: config.CLAUDE_DIRS}` to the spawned parser. (`.env` reaches config.mjs's dotenv but NOT the child's process.env, so the forward is required.)\n\n**Validated:** both server-sync (\"ok (server)\") and direct-sync (\"ok (direct)\") now → **223 sessions: Claude 59, Antigravity 164**. Newest Claude session in the inventory = the current session (2026-07-04); 20 Claude in the last 7 days. So v2's corpus is 223 (vs the old 130) incl. recent Claude Code work.\n\nEach Claude `.jsonl` under `~/.claude/projects/**` = one Session entity (`sessionUUID = hash(filePath)`, `agent:\"Claude\"`); `listSessions` filters `agent.toLowerCase() in ['antigravity','claude']`. 59 > 40 files because the store also holds historical/other-type Claude sessions. Workspace is parameterised by `LONGVIEW_WORKSPACE` (default `longview`); v2 clean run uses `longview_v2`.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1242,"cache_read_input_tokens":539238,"output_tokens":2080,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1242,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2080,"cache_read_input_tokens":539238,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1242,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1242},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CcgiyQCxKpKgQm8RTxa2a","type":"assistant","uuid":"efd2daad-d3fc-40d2-8642-ef2f3f6fdadc","timestamp":"2026-07-04T08:46:07.780Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\OneDrive\\binary16\\prime-silo","sessionId":"4cd9df3b-c431-4ac3-8790-b888629655bb","version":"