{"parentUuid":"b4f85ca9-cc1c-4fe3-b085-e6f5dd4ad29b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01QGaGfyfkQaaa56nm1ycrNU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01J16pFEBBqA8dyjSjyzsA2X","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\.claude\\projects\\C--Users-nsdha-OneDrive-binary16\\memory\\longview_v2_graph_walk_pipeline.md","content":"---\nname: longview-v2-graph-walk-pipeline\ndescription: \"LONGVIEW v2 overhaul: graph-walk lossless extraction (qwen3.5 415-token self-limit), 16k FLM ctx, enrich+review phases, book gates/reflections/coverage, workspace-precedence bug\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n---\n\n2026-07-04, LONGVIEW v2 clean-room run (workspace `longview_v2`, 224 sessions) — the pipeline was overhauled for lossless extraction + enterprise determinism. See [[longview_memoray_source_fix]], [[prime_silo_longview_graph_enrichment]], [[project_longview_session_synthesis]].\n\n**qwen3.5-9b-FLM self-limits output to ~415 tokens** regardless of max_tokens (`finish_reason:\"stop\"` at 414–419 for json/free-form/max=2000 alike — proven by diagnostic). A 12-field session card can't fit → truncated/missing fields; `repairTruncatedJson` salvages syntax but LOSES content. Raising ctx does NOT fix output; it fixes INPUT.\n\n**Graph-walk extraction (commit 4e393cf):** `scripts/longview/lib/walk.mjs` deterministically windows the FULL session timeline (readTimeline; every step covered once — verified 4,999 steps → 534 windows; over-long steps split across windows). map extracts a tiny per-window fragment (`prompts/window_fragment.md`, cached `windows/<sid>/w<chars>_<n>.json` — size-keyed, resume-safe) and **assembles the card losslessly in code** (union/dedup + one small intent call). Pilot: 1/5 ok → **6/6 ok** incl. previously-truncated sessions.\n\n**16k ctx (live):** `~/.cache/lemonade/recipe_options.json` per-model override `\"qwen3.5-9b-FLM\": {\"ctx_size\": 16384}`; restart