longview.mjs lineage <artifact> [--json]`.\n- Server: `server/api/longview_lineage.js` (mirror of `longview_status.js`) — GET\n  `/api/longview_lineage?artifact=…&workspace=…`.\n\n### 3. Real-time telemetry — ledger tail + live panel\n- Server: `server/api/longview_ledger.js` — GET `/api/longview_ledger?since=<line>` returns new\n  ledger entries + current `status.json` (cheap incremental tail; the ledger is append-only JSONL\n  so `since` is just a line offset).\n- Bridge → Documents LONGVIEW panel (`bridge.js` + `view.html`): a **telemetry strip** while a run\n  is live — per-phase progress bar (from status), rolling event feed (last N ledger entries:\n  `map ok b4e58880 32s`, `section p1c2s1 GATE-FAIL`), computed rates (cards/hr, tokens/min,\n  gate pass %), failures counter. 5s polling via the activity-store pattern; no new infra.\n\n### 4. Lineage viewer — breadcrumbs UI\n- Bridge Outputs list: each deliverable (and each card in the session list) gets a **Lineage**\n  action → side pane rendering `createLineageGraphWidget` with the `/api/longview_lineage` tree +\n  a clickable breadcrumb strip (`Book › Part 2 › §p2c4s1 › card 29408413 › session …`).\n- Session nodes deep-link to the existing memo-ray **step_through player** — \"agent interactions\"\n  ground truth is one click from any output.\n\n### Critical files\n- `scripts/longview/lib/retrieve.mjs`, `lib/opus.mjs`, `lib/walk.mjs`, `longview.mjs` (capture)\n- `scripts/longview/lib/lineage.mjs` (new) + `lineage` CLI case in `longview.mjs`\n- `server/api/longview_lineage.js`, `server/api/longview_ledger.js` (new, mirror longview_status.js)\n- `app/L0/_all/mod/_prime_silo/bridge/bridge.js` + `view.html` (telemetry strip + lineage pane)\n- reuse: `widgets/memoray/lineage_graph/index.js`, `runtime_client/activity-store.js`\n\n## Verification\n- Capture: re-map 1 session (`--force --limit 1`) → `windows/<sid>/manifest.json` +\n  `cards/<sid>.meta.json` exist with step ranges; generate 1 opus section on pilot data →\n  `sections/<id>.meta.json` lists real evidence sources.\n- Lineage CLI: `longview lineage card:<sid8>` prints the full chain down to the raw session log\n  path; `lineage section:<id>` includes evidence docs + concept nodes with merge_count/community.\n- API: `/api/longview_lineage?artifact=card:<sid8>` returns the widget-shaped tree;\n  `/api/longview_ledger?since=0` then `since=<n>` returns strictly-append batches.\n- UI: with the live v2 run, the telemetry strip shows map events arriving; open Lineage on a card →\n  tree renders, breadcrumbs click through, session node opens step_through.\n- Determinism: `lineageFor` twice → identical tree (sorted inputs).\n\n## Sequencing\nCapture seams (1) first — they must land before the v2 run reaches reduce/opus so the book gets\nfull lineage. Then assembly+API (2), telemetry (3), viewer (4). All additive; no pipeline behavior\nchanges; the running map phase is unaffected (map meta appears for sessions processed after the\nchange — earlier ones reconstruct from ledger + fragment caches).\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":95,"newStart":1,"newLines":92,"lines":["-# LONGVIEW v2 quality pass — lossless meaning flow, enterprise determinism, cohesive book","+# LONGVIEW observability — real-time telemetry + full output lineage (ontology breadcrumbs)"," "," ## Context"," ","-Review of the full v2 flow (cards → graph → weave → enrich → review → reduce → opus → pdf) after the","-graph-walk pilot (6/6 cards, rich content) found five places where context/concepts/meaning **leak or","-are never consumed**, plus determinism gaps. Goal: every distilled signal flows forward losslessly, the","-pipeline is reproducible and gated (enterprise-grade), and the book reads as one cohesive journey with","-reflections — an outcome greater than the sum of the parts.","+The v2 pipeline has a strong **audit** trail (append-only `ledger.jsonl`, `status.json` heartbeat,","+`run_config` snapshot, COVERAGE.md) but two gaps the user called