proach\n\n### 1. Provenance capture — persist the missing edges at generation time\n- `scripts/longview/lib/retrieve.mjs`: `evidenceFor()` gains a `withSources` return —\n  `{ text, sources: [{kind: chunk|graph, source, sid?}] }` (ragQuery already has `r.source`;\n  today it's thrown away).\n- `lib/opus.mjs` section generation: write `sections/<id>.meta.json` — `{query, sources[],\n  cited_sids[], cited_concepts[] (regex from final text), attempts, tokens, gate, model,\n  git_commit, ts}`.\n- `longview.mjs reduceCall`: write `<deliverable>.meta.json` alongside each output (inputs digest:\n  which rollups/cards/dossiers/reviews fed the call + tokens).\n- map: persist `windows/<sid>/manifest.json` from `walkSessionWindows` (window → step index ranges +\n  chars) and `cards/<sid>.meta.json` (fragment files used, window count, intent tokens). Reviews:\n  extend the existing ledger entry with `{anchors[], related_concepts[]}`.\n- Every meta carries the `run_config` git commit — outputs attributable to exact code.\n\n### 2. Lineage assembly — `scripts/longview/lib/lineage.mjs` + CLI + API\n- `lineageFor(artifactId)`: resolve `book | section:<id> | dossier:<name> | card:<sid8> |\n  review:<sid8>` and walk backwards through the meta files, ledger, window manifests, and the\n  memo-ray store (`readEntity`/`readTimeline`) into a tree:\n  `deliverable → generation call (phase+script+model+tokens+commit) → evidence docs (cards/reviews)\n  → card → windows (step ranges) → session (agent, title, event count, raw log path)`.\n- **Ontology joins:** cited `(concept: X)` → Neo4j concept node (name, `merge_count`, `aliases`,\n  `community_name`) via the `/api/graph/knowledge`-style lookup — the breadcrumbs reach INTO the\n  ontology, not just the files.\n- Output shape = `createLineageGraphWidget`'s `{nodes:[{id,type,label,depth,meta}], links}` plus a\n  linear `breadcrumbs[]` array. CLI: `node scripts/longview/longview.mjs lineage <artifact> [--json]`.\n- Server: `server/api/longview