{"parentUuid":"9b37805c-fe98-4296-840b-18972f661563","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01CvUYXtMMVapLoeNQf6me8w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UFkSYD7fGyUp7oaF6qkJHd","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\nsdha\\.claude\\plans\\warm-beaming-pretzel.md","content":"# Benny Record — step-through playback + live telemetry + full output lineage\n\n## Context\n\nThe v2 pipeline has strong *audit* (append-only `ledger.jsonl`, `run_config`, gates, COVERAGE) but\n(1) no real-time view and (2) no way to pick an output and see the whole tree that made it —\nagents, scripts, LLM calls, evidence, graph concepts (\"ontology breadcrumbs\").\n\nmemo-ray already solved the *experience* problem for sessions: the **step_through player**\n(`app/L0/_all/mod/_prime_silo/step_through/step_through.js`) — a calming step-by-step audit: hero\ncaption, the preceding \"Why?\", raw content/diff, milestone scrubber, a lineage map\n(`createLineageGraphWidget`) highlighting the current step, play/pause/speed, keyboard/gamepad,\nspeech narration. It replays *operator↔agent sessions*.\n\n**The idea (user's): a \"Benny Record\"** — the same experience pointed at *Benny's own work*: replay\nhow the pipeline produced any deliverable, step by step, enriched with everything prime-silo knows —\nmodel calls + tokens, evidence retrievals, gate verdicts, graph-concept deltas, phases, commit. And\nbecause the ledger is append-only, **the same player tail-following the live run IS the real-time\ntelemetry view** — one experience for history and now.\n\n**Timing:** v2 is in map. Landing capture before reduce/opus means the v2 book ships fully\nreplayable.\n\n## Approach\n\n### 1. Provenance capture (the missing edges — prerequisite for everything)\n- `lib/retrieve.mjs` `evidenceFor()`: also return `sources[]` (ragQuery already has `r.source`;\n  today discarded).\n- `lib/opus.mjs`: write `sections/<id>.meta.json` — query,