steps → 534 windows; over-long steps split across windows). map extracts a tiny per-window fragment (`prompts/window_fragment.md`, cached `windows/<sid>/w<chars>_<n>.json` — size-keyed, resume-safe) and **assembles the card losslessly in code** (union/dedup + one small intent call). Pilot: 1/5 ok → **6/6 ok** incl. previously-truncated sessions.\n\n**16k ctx (live):** `~/.cache/lemonade/recipe_options.json` per-model override `\"qwen3.5-9b-FLM\": {\"ctx_size\": 16384}`; restart = kill flm.exe + `POST /api/v1/load {\"model_name\":\"qwen3.5-9b-FLM\"}` (a chat call right after the kill races the respawn — use /load). Verified cmdline `--ctx-len 16384` + a 14,413-token prompt accepted. Antigravity RAM math confirmed (+1.6GB at 16k; 7.3GB free). `.env`: LONGVIEW_WINDOW_CHARS=24000, LONGVIEW_EVIDENCE_BUDGET=20000, LONGVIEW_REDUCE_INPUT=24000 → map ETA 21h → ~6h.\n\n**Quality pass (commit d938448)** — closes the \"leaks\" so the outcome exceeds the sum of parts:\n- renderCardMd 4th H2 `## Concepts and evidence` → deep synthesis anchors on walk-extracted concepts (was re-deriving from prose). Note: model phase skips re-render if data_in doc exists.\n- Fragments extract `operator_traits` (was hardcoded [] though reduce builds the operator profile from it).\n- Deterministic `data_out/TIMELINE.md` (cards sorted period+sid, no LLM) → themes + opus outline/chapters; outline prompt mandates chronological journey with resolution.\n- `review` phase notes ingested as vectors + appended to themes input (were orphaned).\n- **Reflection chapters code-enforced** per part (deterministic single section, grounded in reviewsDigest) — never asked of the model.\n- Gates: sectionGate validates 400–1300 words + ≥2 `(sid:|concept:|doc:)` citations, one retry, keeps best draft, ledgers gate_errors; `COVERAGE.md` (% sessions cited vs cards, threshold LONGVIEW_OPUS_MIN_CITE_COVERAGE=0.35, warn not fatal); `run_config` ledger entry (git commit, model, ctx from recipe_options, budgets, phases).\n- Sorted reads everywhere (loadCards by period+sid, dossiers/reviews sorted).\n\n**CRITICAL BUG caught live (commit c01ea97):** the manifest's hardcoded `\"workspace\": \"longview\"` **unconditionally overrode** `LONGVIEW_WORKSPACE` env — the v2 run silently started against production `longview` (killed at extract; graph untouched; longview's inventory.json now lists 224 sessions — harmless for delta). Fix: env wins when explicitly set. **Always verify the `[run] … → workspace 'X'` log line after launch.**\n\n**Benny Record (commit f45b0cc) — observability layer.** Provenance capture at every seam: `evidenceForWithSources` (retrieve.mjs) persists which chunks/concepts fed each opus section (`sections/<id>.meta.json` incl. cited sids/concepts/gate/tokens); `reduceCall` writes `<out>.meta.json`; map writes `windows/<sid>/manifest.json` (window→step ranges) + `cards/<sid>.meta.json` (card readers must exclude `.meta.json`!). `lib/record.mjs`: `recordFor(scope)` = captioned action timeline from ledger+meta (step_through shape); `lineageFor(scope)` = tree deliverable→evidence→card→windows→session raw log path (+concept nodes). CLI `longview record <scope> [--json]`; APIs `GET /api/longview_record?scope=` + `GET /api/longview_ledger?since=<line>` (append-only tail + heartbeat = live telemetry feed) via longview_service. Verified live on card:b4e58880 — full honest history incl. its earlier gate failure, down to the raw `.jsonl` log. **TODO: the player UI** (`app/L0/.../benny_record/` forked from step_through: scrubber/hero/why + lineage map + live tail + gate chips/token meter + cross-jump to step_through; Bridge ▶ Record buttons) — plan in ~/.claude/plans/warm-beaming-pretzel.md.\n\n**Pipeline now:** inventory → extract → map(walk) → model → code → weave → enrich → **review** → reduce(TIMELINE) → opus(reflections+gates+coverage) → pdf. Full v2 run launched (background, day-scale, resume-safe; `longview status` / Bridge → Documents on longview_v2). Next after completion: veri